      },
      "lineNbr": 801,
      "author": {
        "id": 1081378
      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-09-11T21:16:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The other way I\u0027ve often heard these expressed is that locking a mutex costs less than an L2 cache miss, so if you haven\u0027t optimized for cache locality, it\u0027s not yet time to optimize by removing mutexes.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 800,
        "startChar": 58,
        "endLine": 801,
        "endChar": 64
      },
      "revId": "00e2d2be4a60d6fc010d531dfe48781574fd9428",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
